# Pick Your Poison, third mode, with nothing to sacrifice: Bot2 controls only Llanowar Elves, which does not fly, so nothing is
# sacrificed and Bot2 is not asked to choose anything (the bare refusal). The spell still resolves: a mode with no target is always
# castable. The control with a flier is the other flying scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Pick Your Poison
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pick Your Poison.Cast
Bot1.Modes(3)
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Choose
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Pick Your Poison
